/-- U2: a native odd H¹ scalar has local zero trace on the flat plane.
The compact cutoff need not be even. Its native H¹₀ approximation uses the
actual cutoffGradient of the supplied weak gradient, on the upper half-ball.
Source: the sealed uniform-Q unit-scale plan's U2 local native-space leaf,
supporting the hemisphere interpretation of Morrey Definition 5.5.1′. -/
theorem odd_H1_cutoff_H10_native_approximation
    (R : ℝ) (hR : 0 < R) (u : E2 → ℝ) (du : E2 → E2)
    (hu : H1On (Metric.ball (0 : E2) R) u du)
